WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
<v odalys castellanos>are we waiting on anyone?

00:00:02.867 --> 00:00:05.867
<v zoltan oyelaran>just nikhil. oh, there she is.

00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:09.267
<v siobhan delacroix>sorry, sorry. back to back today.

00:00:09.467 --> 00:00:12.867
<v zoltan oyelaran>no worries. okay. let's get into it.

00:00:13.067 --> 00:00:14.400
<v odalys castellanos>sure.

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:21.000
<v zoltan oyelaran>where we landed last week: 1,102 licences of pathwise scheduler, three-year term.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.667
<v siobhan delacroix>two-year. we said two.

00:00:23.867 --> 00:00:26.267
<v zoltan oyelaran>two, sorry. two-year.

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:30.533
<v ugo chaudhry>at two years the list is $80 million annually.

00:00:30.733 --> 00:00:32.333
<v siobhan delacroix>too high.

00:00:32.533 --> 00:00:33.867
<v ugo chaudhry>okay.

00:00:34.067 --> 00:00:36.733
<v siobhan delacroix>our number is one hundred

00:00:36.933 --> 00:00:38.933
<v odalys castellanos>and that's firm

00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:43.533
<v siobhan delacroix>thirty thousand dollars per year, support included.

00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:45.867
<v zoltan oyelaran>that's a big gap.

00:00:46.067 --> 00:00:51.733
<v siobhan delacroix>it's what halvorsen paid for the old system. board won't approve more.

00:00:51.933 --> 00:00:57.600
<v ugo chaudhry>if we drop premium support we can get to maybe 4.5 percent under list.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:02.800
<v odalys castellanos>we need premium support. we had a four-day outage last year.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:09.533
<v zoltan oyelaran>right. um. what if we phase it? start with 1,907 seats in hollin bay, expand in q3.

00:01:09.733 --> 00:01:11.333
<v siobhan delacroix>possible.

00:01:11.533 --> 00:01:18.200
<v odalys castellanos>does the pathwise scheduler connector work with teskara beauty? that's our hr system.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:21.000
<v ugo chaudhry>yes. native integration.

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:22.533
<v odalys castellanos>okay.

00:01:22.733 --> 00:01:31.400
<v zoltan oyelaran>also, uh, how verson would qualify for gannet -- that's our early adopter program -- which takes another chunk off.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:33.667
<v siobhan delacroix>how big a chunk?

00:01:33.867 --> 00:01:36.733
<v ugo chaudhry>roughly forty seven percent.

00:01:36.933 --> 00:01:38.800
<v siobhan delacroix>send it over.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:42.933
<v zoltan oyelaran>will do. the pilot deposit, invoice or card?

00:01:43.133 --> 00:01:48.600
<v siobhan delacroix>card. i'll read it out: 5555 5555 5555 4444. expiry is on the form.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.800
<v ugo chaudhry>got it. thanks.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.533
<v zoltan oyelaran>contract by 2025-09-06?

00:01:53.733 --> 00:01:56.200
<v siobhan delacroix>if the number's right.

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:58.133
<v odalys castellanos>thanks all.

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.533
<v zoltan oyelaran>thanks. talk soon.
